166 {\cf20    if the file does not exist.  If the file does not exist and}\par
167 {\cf20    DOES_NOT_EXIST is not NULL, the function will return -1 and will}\par
168 {\cf20    not call ERROR_CALLBACK.  On other errors, or if DOES_NOT_EXIST is}\par
169 {\cf20    NULL, the function will call ERROR_CALLBACK before returning.  */}\par
